/*
 * Error Test: E4016 - undefined-type-in-container
 * Expected: "undefined type 'zag'; check the spelling or import the module that defines it"
 *
 * A container types as an array or a map whatever its elements name, so
 * checking the annotation as a whole never looked inside one and this
 * reached the C compiler. The diagnostic names the offending leaf, not the
 * whole spelling.
 */

do main() {
    mut items [zag] = {}  // zag is not defined
}
